Project Design Phase PhaseProject Design Phase – PocketSmart AI: Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

1. System Design

PocketSmart AI is designed as a web-based budget management system that helps users track expenses, manage budgets, and receive personalized financial recommendations.

2. Main Modules

User Module – User registration and login.

Dashboard Module – Displays income, expenses, savings, and budget status.

Expense Management – Add, edit, delete, and categorize expenses.

Budget Management – Set monthly/category-wise budgets.

AI Recommendation Module – Provides personalized spending and saving suggestions.

Receipt/OCR Module – Extracts expense information from receipts.

Reports Module – Generates expense summaries and charts.


3. System Architecture

User → Web Interface → Application Logic → Database → AI Recommendation Engine

The user enters financial information through the web interface. The application processes and stores the data in the database. The AI recommendation engine analyzes spending patterns and provides suitable suggestions.

4. Database Design

Important tables include:

Users – User ID, name, email, password

Transactions – Transaction ID, user ID, amount, category, date

Budgets – Budget ID, user ID, category, limit

Recommendations – Recommendation ID, user ID, message, date


5. User Interface Design

The dashboard contains:

Total income

Total expenses

Remaining balance

Savings

Budget progress

Expense charts

Recent transactions

AI-generated recommendations


6. Recommendation Design

The system analyzes expenses and identifies unnecessary or excessive spending. It can provide recommendations such as:

“You are spending more on food this month.”

“Try reducing entertainment expenses.”

“You can save ₹2,000 by staying within your monthly budget.”


7. Technology Used

Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript

Backend: Python/Node.js

Database: MySQL

AI: Recommendation/AI-based analysis

Charts: Chart.js


8. Expected Output

The final system provides a simple and interactive platform where users can track expenses, manage budgets, understand spending habits, and receive smart recommendations for better financial management.
